## Install

1. Drop the `Scripts/` folder into your project's `Assets/`.
2. Add the `{{ s.name }}` component to a systems GameObject.
3. Call `ReportProgress(objectiveId, amount)` from gameplay code (or via
   `SendMessage("ReportProgress", objectiveId)`) as the player makes progress.
4. Subscribe to the events:

```csharp
var tracker = GetComponent<{{ s.name }}>();
tracker.OnObjectiveProgress += (id, cur, req) => Debug.Log($"{id}: {cur}/{req}");
tracker.OnObjectiveComplete += id => Debug.Log($"Objective complete: {id}");
tracker.OnMissionComplete   += () => Debug.Log("Mission complete!");
```

