Mission completes when every non-optional objective reaches its required count.
`triggers`/`story_beat_ref` from the authored `MissionSpec` are not wired to any
trigger-execution engine yet — hook `OnObjectiveComplete`/`OnMissionComplete` up
to your own trigger/cutscene logic manually.
